	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>とおく　シンオウちほう　に
ダークライと　いう　ポケモンあり▼
じぶんを　まもるため　まわりに
わるい　ゆめを　みせるなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>遠く　シンオウ地方に
ダークライと　いう　ポケモンあり▼
自分を　守るため　周りに
悪い　夢を　みせるなり</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・GRIDX＝14～17、GRIDZ＝9</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T12:13:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>本棚</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:01:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book3_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スリープという　ポケモンあり▼
ねむらせては　ユメを　たべるが
わるい　ユメばかり　たべてると▽
おなかを　こわすことが　あるらしい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スリープという　ポケモンあり▼
ねむらせては　ユメを　食べるが
悪い　ユメばかり　食べてると▽
おなかを　こわすことが　あるらしい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-17T12:24:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・GRIDX＝21～24、GRIDZ＝9</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T12:13:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>本棚</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:01:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
