	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book4_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スリーパーという　ポケモンあり▼
ふりこのようなものを　もちあるき
こどもに　さいみんじゅつを　かけて▽
どこかへ　つれさる　じけんが　あった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スリーパーという　ポケモンあり▼
ふりこのようなものを　持ち歩き
こどもに　さいみんじゅつを　かけて▽
どこかへ　連れ去る　事件が　あった</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・GRIDX＝7～10、GRIDZ＝12</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T12:13:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>本棚</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:01:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book5_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンのわざ　ゆめくい▼
ねている　あいての　ゆめを
たべて　こうげきする▼
ダメージの　はんぶん
ＨＰを　かいふくする</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの技　ゆめくい▼
ねている　相手の　ゆめを
食べて　攻撃する▼
ダメージの　半分　ＨＰを　回復する</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・GRIDX＝14～17、GRIDZ＝12</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T12:13:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>本棚</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:01:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book6_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンのとくせい　よちむ▼
あいてが　もっている
わざを　ひとつ　よみとれる▼
いりょくの　たかい　わざを
ゆうせんして　よみとる</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの特性　よちむ▼
相手が　持っている
技を　ひとつ　読み取れる▼
威力の　高い　技を
優先して　読み取る</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:05:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>BGメッセージ
・GRIDX＝21～24、GRIDZ＝12</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-24T12:13:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>本棚</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T06:41:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:01:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#8080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d25r0401_book7_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たかい　たな　いっぱいに
がいこくの　ほんが　おさめられている</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:09:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
