				Time="2011-09-01T10:09:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>高い棚　一杯に
外国の　本が　収納されている</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T10:09:01" />
